OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear
OL,6,Fintervals and blustery showers,
OL,7,Faccompanied by gale force
OL,8,Fsouthwesterly winds during the
OL,9,Fevening, these gradually easing strong
OL,10,Fovernight with the showers becoming
OL,11,Fless frequent.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA mixture of bright or
OL,14,Fsunny intervals and occasional
OL,15,Fshowers. Fresh to strong southwesterly
OL,16,Fwinds.
